---
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="py-12 bg-slate-950 border-t border-slate-900 text-slate-400 font-mono text-xs">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6">
      <!-- Left Info -->
      <div class="space-y-1 text-center md:text-left">
        <div class="text-slate-200 font-semibold">
          Michele Dilollo <span class="text-emerald-400">•</span> DFIR & Incident Response Expert
        </div>
        <p class="text-slate-500 text-[11px]">
          Progettato con standard enterprise: Static Site Generation, zero JavaScript non necessario, accessibilità WCAG 2.1 AA.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Center / Badges -->
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-[11px]">
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 text-emerald-400">
          Astro 5 SSG
        </span>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 text-cyan-400">
          Tailwind CSS v4
        </span>
        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 text-indigo-400">
          WCAG 2.1 AA
        </span>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Links -->
      <div class="flex items-center gap-6 text-slate-400">
        <a
          href="https://github.com/isf3t/micheleDilollo.github.io"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors"
        >
          GitHub Repo
        </a>
        <a href="#hero" class="hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors flex items-center gap-1">
          <span>Torna su</span>
          <span>↑</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-slate-900/80 text-center text-[11px] text-slate-600">
      © {currentYear} Michele Dilollo. Tutti i diritti riservati. Tutti i marchi citati appartengono ai rispettivi proprietari.
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
